# Trees this repository does not author, so the linter has nothing to say
# about them. dataset/ and data/ are sample inputs, and the dist-mcp trees are
# build output of src/, which is scanned on its own.
dataset/
data/
dist-mcp/
dist-mcp.bak/
dist-mcp.old/

# Third-party reference docs shipped so the agent can read them, written by
# Hive Workshop authors, not by this repository.
src/Wc3.Mcp/context/

# Vendored licence text. The licence clause "subject to the following
# conditions" is quoted from Apache and Mozilla and must not be reworded.
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md

# Agent work logs and captured diffs. A progress report records what ran on a
# day, and rewriting its words would falsify the record.
.superpowers/
.loop/

# The skill documents ship in two places, docs/ and context/, and the pair must stay
# byte for byte identical. Their prose belongs to the shipped skill.
src/Wc3.Mcp/docs/skills/

